<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 10,766 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 5,400 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  178   (195 and 160)</p>
<p>    Good		152   (152 and 140)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     142   (140 and 122)</p>
<p>    Medium	    137   (133 and 102)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	unq   (unq and  82)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 178 pence for an Kenya PD</p>
</text>
